cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below once the paper is published."
type: software
title: "MAE-UNETR for Simulated Revision Surgery"
abstract: >
  An automatic deep learning pipeline for pre-operative femoral reconstruction
  in revision total knee arthroplasty. The pipeline combines 3D CT segmentation
  with a transformer-based reconstruction network to estimate full femoral
  geometry under simulated implant-presence or distal-resection conditions.
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/renyangry/MAE-UNETR-for-simulated-revision-surgery"

